    "shortDescription": "<p style=\"text-align: center\">Bacteriostatic Water is a sterile, non-pyrogenic solution designed for diluting peptide supplements. Formulated with 0.9% benzyl alcohol as a preservative, it ensures stability and safety during storage. Ideal for reconstitution of lyophilized peptides, this high-quality water maintains the integrity of your compounds, providing a reliable base for your supplementation needs. Experience the precision and convenience that Bacteriostatic Water brings to your peptide regimen.</p>",
    "description": "<p style=\"text-align: right\"><span style=\"font-weight: 600\">Bacteriostatic Water</span> is a sterile water solution specifically designed for the reconstitution of peptides and other medications. This compound contains a small percentage of benzyl alcohol, which acts as a bacteriostatic agent, preventing the growth of bacteria and ensuring the integrity and safety of the solution over time. Bacteriostatic Water is commonly utilized in the pharmaceutical and research communities for its ability to maintain the stability of sensitive compounds, making it an essential component in peptide therapies and other injectable treatments.</p>\n<p>With its unique formulation, Bacteriostatic Water facilitates the safe and effective delivery of peptides, allowing for flexibility in dosing while minimizing the risk of contamination. It is imperative for professionals and researchers alike to employ this compound in compliance with proper handling and storage protocols to ensure optimal results.</p>\n<h2>Features &amp; Benefits:</h2>\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom: .9rem\">\n<li><strong>Bacteriostatic properties</strong>: Contains benzyl alcohol to inhibit bacterial growth, ensuring product integrity.</li>\n<li><strong>Versatile usage</strong>: Ideal for reconstituting peptides, hormones, and other medications for injectable use.</li>\n<li><strong>Enhanced stability</strong>: Maintains the efficacy of sensitive compounds during storage and usage.</li>\n<li><strong>Ease of use</strong>: Designed for simple reconstitution and administration, making it user-friendly for both professionals and researchers.</li>\n<li><strong>Quality assurance</strong>: Manufactured under strict quality control measures to guarantee sterility and safety.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Storage &amp; Handling:</h2>\n<p>Bacteriostatic Water should be stored at room temperature, between 15\u00b0C and 25\u00b0C (59\u00b0F and 77\u00b0F), in a dry place away from direct sunlight and heat sources.</p>\n<h2>Research Use Cases:</h2>\n<p>Research shows that Bacteriostatic Water is primarily used for the reconstitution of peptides and other injectables in clinical and laboratory settings. Its bacteriostatic properties make it particularly advantageous for long-term storage and repeated use, minimizing the risk of contamination. This compound is essential for researchers and healthcare professionals who require a reliable and sterile solution for their peptide formulations. As always, consultation with a healthcare professional is advised when utilizing Bacteriostatic Water in any therapeutic context.</p>",
